18
01:13:55,714 --> 01:14:01,714
Talks of a fourth Men in Black film began after the
release of Men in Black 3 in 2012.

19
01:18:02,142 --> 01:18:08,142
In February 2018, Hemsworth signed on to lead a spin-off, Gray was hired to
direct, and Thompson joined the cast the following month.

20
01:22:08,571 --> 01:22:14,571
